{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_title", "source_sha256": "130be83b290b32a0e983f9207909b0132dae5656e5e0b6512a4bf90349841a57", "ja": "飾らない言葉　飾れない心", "zh": "毫不掩饰的话，毫不掩饰的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42101374832a33ef76b772855834af508ec3930271ba7bf0d2caee050591bc55", "ja": "次回公演のセンターに選ばれ、一人でレッス\nンに励む志保。プロデューサーはそんな志保\nに、伊織とやよいの練習を見学しないかと提\n案する。仲間の大切さを学んだ志保は、可奈\nや茜とレッスンを再開、公演を成功に導く。", "zh": "志保被选为下次公演的Center后，\n便独自一人专心在训练课程上。制作人见状，\n便建议她去观摩伊织和弥生的练习。\n志保体会到伙伴的重要性之后，\n与可奈和茜重启训练课程，为公演带来成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1000_p", "source_sha256": "14ecf4a6a3310ac22eb84fbb10fac204c2b66cc2b4a3d15d4c3716f94da4c139", "ja": "（志保にセンターを頼んでから数日が経った。\n公演に向けて、レッスンをしてるはずだけど……）", "zh": "（拜托志保担任Center之后已经过了几天。\n她为了公演，应该正在加紧训练……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "8c8351e97be1f9e69275ae5e9da8579ded7335fd3389f6ef5ba1e989700fbe67", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……ふぅ。\n今の感じね。忘れないうちにもう1回……。", "zh": "呼、呼……呼。\n刚刚的感觉对了，趁还没忘记再来一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4552986695418a8e9b230bd68b03a57fbb9501a049e2aa4f8b5e3d43fdf416a4", "ja": "志保、ダンスの振り付けの確認か？\n……今日も、誰とも一緒じゃないんだな。", "zh": "志保，你在确认舞步吗？\n……今天也是自己一个人，没跟别人一起呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "2455a36a3dd24880241ab413bd4b25df202d3f35d9adc3931dbca4cf7949eb8e", "ja": "はい。ひとりで練習した方が効率がいいので。\n{$P$}さん、何か用ですか？", "zh": "对，自己练习比较有效率。\n{$P$}先生，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bc4a7310dddc262987397ec211b887cb7906b4bb6b1c1774468e574cc6f032bb", "ja": "いや、ちょっと様子を見に来ただけなんだが……。", "zh": "没有啦，我只是来看看你的状况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1005_p", "source_sha256": "34833dfbb4797d065198fb8695f42d063c68b7167d7e6a5b15ddbb7466f14519", "ja": "（センターに決まってから、志保は前にも増して\nひとりで練習するようになった気がする）", "zh": "（自从被选为Center之后，\n感觉志保比以前更常自己一个人练习了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "49836903c1a36f8b0ed5264922239488ef5622b99a218f3e75b4ecc0a0b7105b", "ja": "うっうー！　おはようございまーっす！", "zh": "呜呜──！大家早──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "f9b6b4bd9236450b2e84c34bcc5d647c696537fec568265f7eb2585b7855c8a1", "ja": "ちょっと、やよい！　そんなに急がなくても……。\nあら、{$P$}と志保じゃない。", "zh": "喂，弥生！不用这么赶……\n哎呀，这不是{$P$}跟志保吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9f9ec35960b4dc5602118d36269ae0f2919cb188bf4930f810a72ea46dc067d0", "ja": "お疲れさま。やよいと伊織も、自主練か？", "zh": "辛苦了。弥生跟伊织也是来自主练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "1a934269575cff122fe104a187f165d42235529785017fe151f317767911ed1d", "ja": "はいっ！　今度のライブで、伊織ちゃんとふたりで\nペアになって踊るダンスの練習です～。", "zh": "没错！下次演唱会我会跟伊织搭档，\n现在就是要练表演时的舞蹈～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "12547f258f47c89f3645fe4c9485a3e8bc08400a2e4230d32f2dd32e669ee089", "ja": "目立つパートだから、みっともないのは絶対イヤだし、\nさすがに少しは練習しておかないとね。", "zh": "因为是很醒目的部分，我绝对不想出糗，\n确实是该预先练习一下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "2b3db1f4225d450f71791308493b4395c12ac8cc689733a6e8f646278d864ed4", "ja": "ま、今日は他の仕事もあるから、軽く合わせるぐらい\nしかできないけど。はあ～、人気者ってツライわ♪", "zh": "不过，我们今天还有其他工作，只能稍微合练就是了。\n唉～当个红人还真累呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "453d3651a88a46f624efa859828437f0c223d0cd0793f9dd3b8f68c23e82bdba", "ja": "えへへっ、伊織ちゃん！　ふたりでダンスするの、\n今からす～っごく楽しみだねっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，伊织！我现在就已经好期待好期待～\n到时候跟你共舞了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "ec2e98a95ba980e2d456670c66bb364dd861ed0d642d36e9066e3be791c0dfbc", "ja": "でも振り付けがむずかしいから、\n私、ちゃんと出来るか、ちょっと心配だけど……。", "zh": "可是这次的舞步很难，\n我有点担心自己会跳不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "82ae01bbc4b2c02a46d77743cf1e487d8ca7299d668172db08505d1fe0d75870", "ja": "なに弱気なこと言ってるのよ、らしくないわね。\nちゃんと出来るようになるために練習するんじゃない。", "zh": "你在说什么丧气话啊，真不像你。\n我们不就是为了跳好才来练习的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "ebb839ce9512d67554bf2897d94f3713b2d9b09c7f73c6b3be389d9ee15baf6b", "ja": "それに……あんたなら大丈夫よ。頑張り屋だし……\nわ、私もついているんだから。そうでしょ？", "zh": "而且……你不会有问题的。毕竟你那么努力……\n还、还有我在身边，怕什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "07c3e9c725d7c99cba0e07d9821c8edc9f721a53fa4dabfb5befe7a418f62848", "ja": "伊織ちゃん……。\nうんっ、ありがとう！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "伊织……\n嗯，谢谢你！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7704585b316ef6b297c377edc2d5218d2145d6e0e0657849203a854cf6d1b291", "ja": "志保、休憩がてら、\n伊織達の練習を見学してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "志保，你要不要休息一下，\n顺道观摩看看伊织她们的练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "39dbd801bda8e4bf3a1c54d7a939fd9ee4552441c7a47301aec2f6ea5312354a", "ja": "え？　……いえ。まだ自分の振り付けを\n確認してる最中なので、やめておきます。", "zh": "咦？……不用，我自己的舞步都还没确认完，\n先算了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1021_p", "source_sha256": "32b789d7c21caf76c33a7409de2422e4a985346cf653abfab09c2f44b34d542e", "ja": "まあ、そう言わないで。何か気づくことも\nあるかもしれないし。……ふたりも別にいいよな？", "zh": "哎呀，别这么说嘛。或许会带来什么灵感也说不定……\n你们俩也不在意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "b2c909ba8b98f50e1ff22feb76429f78474ef64d840f63cecefa995c1050b307", "ja": "ええ、構わないわよ？\n観客がいた方が、やりがいがあるくらい♪", "zh": "嗯，没有问题喔。\n旁边有观众反而会更有干劲呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "5edd173d9a8a240326a9232031be72f0e59daca259008ebd733e574b2c0fa5ae", "ja": "じゃあ、今からやってみますね。えへへ、ドキドキ\nするけど頑張りまーす！　志保ちゃんも応援してね！", "zh": "那要开始啰。嘿嘿，虽然有点紧张，\n但我会加油的──！志保也要帮我们打气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "d4b71a59c9291e1004f9b8dd0c2341a0e28e1c90f4ce8ba8c4b0d06bc7d351d3", "ja": "……わかりました。\nそれじゃあ、見学させてもらいます。", "zh": "……我知道了。\n那我就在旁边观摩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "87ca23c6013b5face8238eb0bc7e717869d6f220ba51903f722bf43f34fb56cd", "ja": "1、2、3、4……それで、最後にキメポーズ！\nいぇい！！", "zh": "1、2、3、4……接着，最后来个可爱姿势！\n耶！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "f9e15b0d7a5122d03d839fc0392e9b3f94557e863a075caeb07d391147815486", "ja": "ふぅ、お疲れ様！　……まあ、こんなものかしら？\n初めてにしては、なかなかよかったんじゃない？", "zh": "呼，辛苦了！……嗯，差不多就这样吧？\n以第一次来说，感觉还不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1028_p", "source_sha256": "987224d2f5b3efbd506d109a5ba51a2142f3cb188c0fbcb59a7323abc69a4872", "ja": "確かに踊れてはいたな。\nでも、まだミスが多いぞ？", "zh": "虽然是会跳没错，\n但你们的失误还很多喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "b0295c1d6461f3f104ada0cf54c76d7e9f954f81aa8e23297cb8d8876d6dd6be", "ja": "わかってるわよっ。仕方ないでしょ、振り付けが\n決まったばかりなんだから。細かいトコはこれから！", "zh": "这我当然知道！但也没办法啊，\n舞步才刚定案，比较细的部分之后再修！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "b3a65bed13097d667e192ac4cd4579c6246ff087917c6cfe019309abddfcd234", "ja": "ミスって……ほとんど気づかなかった。\n自然で、キレイで……これで初めてだなんて……。", "zh": "失误……我根本就没有发现。\n看上去是那么自然、动人……这居然是第一次跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "194a698c811422aabbd6fa80375da6db075925c9d7cc1f40708d7cbae5944f0a", "ja": "あら、志保。もしかして、\n私達のレベルの高さに驚いちゃったかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，志保，你该不会……\n被我们的舞蹈水准之高给吓着了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "894dd2157b8800bd9075ed38824131013def7a48df171f88dfe57f383eec2a71", "ja": "っ、別に……。", "zh": "唔，才没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "0fc6d61f95b121a3bea9220c76c32a4025cf9fa69becb812acf3237d74f84f50", "ja": "ふん、素直じゃないわねー。他の子をよーく見て、\nいいとこを参考にしなきゃ、成長できないわよ。", "zh": "哼，真是不老实。你应该好好看看别人，\n参考她们的优点，不然不会进步喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "80547c1788436c8599511175c5bc40b5e8e9e7916adde1d648b2f7a138332ad8", "ja": "あんた、次の定期公演のセンターなんでしょ？\nそんな調子じゃ、先が思いやられるわね。", "zh": "你不是下次定期公演的Center吗？\n照你现在的状态，真是未来堪忧啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "e7624f15a0c3d4b624510d05a5c069f957a57b1b8f353469d7c5bc9788df9a0e", "ja": "もう、伊織ちゃん、そういう言い方したらダメだよっ！\n志保ちゃんは一生懸命なんだから……めっ！", "zh": "真是的，伊织，你怎么能这样讲话！\n志保也是拚了命在努力……你坏坏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1036_007ior", "source_sha256": "e2d170271cc88aef248d08ceb601af0ead84c89440cd882fe69d487d71032a62", "ja": "な、なによ、私はただ、ちょっとハッパをかけて\nやらなきゃって思っただけで……。", "zh": "什、什么嘛，我只是觉得说，\n自己应该激励她一下才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1037_005yay", "source_sha256": "a6c75b9092becb676fc3da5bf176ac3c2d779500a33cc6bdab631a7e61a7e56f", "ja": "ごめんね、志保ちゃん。伊織ちゃんは、\n「頑張ってね」って言いたかっただけだって。", "zh": "志保，对不起喔。\n伊织她啊，只是想跟你说声「要加油喔」而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1038_007ior", "source_sha256": "29054bba51bd3ae6661641ffc52bf944aff0ba2b3bef89e39799d9eaf4a0ee3c", "ja": "ちょっと！？\nそんなこと、ひとことも言ってないでしょ！？", "zh": "喂！？\n我才没有这样讲好吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1039_p", "source_sha256": "fa86ca03d8cf92f33852e46ae8f6915754ace3b5bce58a13b3d8d69bd43e6826", "ja": "……あ、そういえばふたりとも、次の仕事は？\n時間無いって言ってたよな、さっき。", "zh": "……啊，话说你们两个，下个工作呢？\n刚刚不是听你们说没时间了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1040_005yay", "source_sha256": "a7e1a03cf6417140c3f84eeda9a1fdda7c3e8f0f8899061152564e51ac1b0630", "ja": "あっ、そうでしたっ！　ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}！　伊織ちゃん、行こっ？", "zh": "啊，对耶！谢谢你的提醒，{$P$}！\n伊织，我们走吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "3209519d85ec056eeb502d28adc36a4330f3fd69d0ab4c4e3483f29acce4bd4f", "ja": "そ……、そうね。それは言ったわね……。\nそれじゃあ志保、しっかりしなさいよ？", "zh": "也……也对，是有这么说过……\n那就再见啰～志保，你自己要振作一点喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1043_p", "source_sha256": "902e497cb949c270adeaab6f8a1b804f09bae580618b7d347d970a163f5b6993", "ja": "志保、ふたりのダンスは参考になったか？\nずっと食い入るように見てたけど。", "zh": "志保，她们的舞蹈有给你什么帮助吗？\n我看你从头到尾都目不转睛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1044_033sih", "source_sha256": "7c1fac7ece05c635834b827d11c0445de4b0b26b9eeb57baf6e083712fb9f289", "ja": "……はい。", "zh": "……有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1045_033sih", "source_sha256": "95eea94cd123f0e1427b4d0e63ca4b4cda9558e369ae94562791bdfb04b28f5b", "ja": "正直、すごいと思いました。出だしからひきこまれて、\nミスがあったことにも気づかなかった……。", "zh": "老实说，我很佩服她们。\n我从开头就深受吸引，连有失误都没注意到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "cf9786102160facd06f4b4fd1e9cc485fac766271388aa2c616254b87e527679", "ja": "どうして、そう感じたのかはわかりませんけど……。\nふたりの実力が、すごいから……なのか……？", "zh": "我不明白为什么会有这种感觉……\n是因为她们两个……实力坚强吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1047_p", "source_sha256": "da6ecb15a050c3733419a9c64e3221540978439d99f22de3590b72cc0b3c6049", "ja": "それだけじゃないはず……って顔だな。\n俺も、実力やレベルは関係ないと思う。", "zh": "你的表情写着「应该不只是这样……」。\n我也觉得这跟实力还有水准之类的无关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1048_p", "source_sha256": "d9370ad6d794921be1692044475b7661ffb99e25fe7f88a0d52caba6b5f675b8", "ja": "秘訣は、わりと単純なことじゃないかな。\nあのふたりは、ただ……。", "zh": "其实秘诀，要比你想的还简单。\n那两个人，就只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_1049", "source_sha256": "04c1f09e585770a272162b3994e5ed9b3596d00ad2b194bbc79e67b4f789ccb3", "ja": "ライバル関係", "zh": "互为竞争关系", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0594a654e001cfdb27a12bfcdbbf76d8e20b3c8c0947112d111c0e8ebe248897", "ja": "ライバル関係なだけだ。それだけだよ。", "zh": "互为竞争关系而已，就只有这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2001_033sih", "source_sha256": "4dc68df5f8adacc9847fa316cf7d8afaed6c4fb0d0bc0e3df22da1c6acc863d7", "ja": "……なに言ってるんですか？\nあんなに仲がよさそうなのに。", "zh": "……你在胡说什么？\n她们看起来感情这么好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2002_p", "source_sha256": "feecf3a54fb4cf34eb589267542dac998338bca06414ef66d281c37480d6526e", "ja": "仲がいいから、お互いに相手がまぶしいんだよ。\n認め合えている友達だから、楽しく高め合える。", "zh": "正因为感情好，彼此在对方眼中才会显得耀眼。\n正因为是互相认同的朋友，才能一起笑着提升彼此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2003_p", "source_sha256": "553e2ef148467526f008e0abe8c311023ec73c19d670788ac0442da8ce5e0702", "ja": "だからふたりのダンスは、観ている人がつい\n引きこまれるほど、輝いて見えるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想就是因为这样，她们俩的舞蹈才会如此光采动人，\n让旁人不禁看得入迷吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2004_033sih", "source_sha256": "9f22d80edb7d5a71b7a169005e126c9bf00c0f1c531e5b311e664cd1b51a1c5b", "ja": "友達だから……。", "zh": "因为是朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2005_p", "source_sha256": "b7be38757b3d384027df9bfbfc67116761096a27f9f74f025666f334d825909d", "ja": "それに、一緒にいる時間が長いと息も合ってくる。\nお互いの動きもクセも、わかってくるだろうし……。", "zh": "而且，相处久了默契也越好。\n渐渐会知道彼此有什么动作跟习惯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2006_033sih", "source_sha256": "4038c39f6f80c5efd46372602219ca0edc722351424199f576721739088743fe", "ja": "ああ……。だから、ひとりだけ頑張ってもムダだって、\n言いたいんですね。", "zh": "原来是这样……所以，自己一个人埋头苦干也没用，\n这就是你的意思对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2007_p", "source_sha256": "289915ab49fd6316e78c056d75efec06fd0dbf2dcdeaaabea9cc613d63d0b2c7", "ja": "ムダってことはない。センターは目立つから、\nミスしないよう、きっちりと覚えることも大事だ。", "zh": "绝对不会没用。Center毕竟是万众瞩目的对象，\n为了不失误，记好舞步也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2008_p", "source_sha256": "c69323b41f74beac358a60997b7b9065e56b2cb973808443261d393bdf7bebf9", "ja": "ただお客さんが観てるのは、センターひとりじゃ\nないからな。メンバー全員で作るステージだ。", "zh": "但观众看的不会只有Center一个人，\n他们看的是全体成员一起呈现的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2009_p", "source_sha256": "f2ee73352851d568e3fb205cdbb6cb236b6b1e71a62d9ee99aac8ea5d09a29a2", "ja": "見た人をひきこむ、一体感のあるステージを作るよう\n働きかけるのも、センターの大事な仕事だと思うよ。", "zh": "如何促成一场吸引观众、充满一体感的表演，\n我觉得这也是Center重要的职责之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2010_033sih", "source_sha256": "7f586616dd7313d3636cb8fd9c79877ef28fb3591899c4da45e70ddbf4256a34", "ja": "センターの仕事………………。", "zh": "Center的职责………………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2011_033sih", "source_sha256": "cd78ffe97a495fe759b983799bbeab671fc3c7ce68775fd81fbbd010284ae7a8", "ja": "それでも、やっぱり私は、\n個々のレベルを上げる必要はあると思います。", "zh": "即便如此，我还是觉得，\n提升个人水准有它的必要性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2012_033sih", "source_sha256": "d6c174dbc49e0058b95fdeecf56d831dbf261a1ab178cf810b33d3cdc007d2a0", "ja": "レベルが低ければ、そもそも\n人と合わせることすら、できませんから。", "zh": "水准要是太低，\n根本连和别人搭档跳舞都不可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2013_p", "source_sha256": "6fcde9f77cfb043ea68d585d42d461b154cde9883ffef91cb67d32811e504b9b", "ja": "ああ、ひとりひとりの技術も大切だぞ。\n文字通り、切磋琢磨してほしいな。", "zh": "没错，每个人的技术当然也很重要。\n希望你能做到名符其实的「切磋琢磨」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2015_033sih", "source_sha256": "99edc3862914d71997d4d81d3d286d6b4f058ef86dfe0adc8fd2a2329d57c457", "ja": "とにかく……{$P$}さんの\n言いたいことはわかりました。", "zh": "总之……我明白{$P$}先生\n想说什么了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2016_033sih", "source_sha256": "73230ab53a166b183a483fd816c9205bcad7fe6937fe9378ea7144ec9ef334b9", "ja": "なので、これからは個人の練習と並行して、\n矢吹さん達とも練習したいと思います。", "zh": "所以今后，我打算除了个人练习之外，\n同时也会安排时间跟矢吹她们练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2017_se", "source_sha256": "b8703c3059553d15c7ff50eefe79011dd74b664f4b3aff75b2aa244af9dbf40e", "ja": "ガチャッ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2018_036kan", "source_sha256": "9b4b5e5ca5fe4167302c1adb4921e5b14ffce0f85cd9612d7f483591be2d85f1", "ja": "志保ちゃん！\nホントに一緒に練習していいの！？", "zh": "志保！\n我们真的可以跟你一起练习吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2020_023aka", "source_sha256": "878911bd7b10cd6dbba6fcd6b43eb994d45ca19042c854f0a135c6404f6b788f", "ja": "じゃじゃん！　しほりんのことが気になって、レッスン\nルームを覗いてた茜ちゃんと愉快な仲間たち登場ー！", "zh": "锵锵！太在意志保保，\n而一直在偷窥练习室的小茜和愉快的伙伴们登场──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_015_2021_023aka", "source_sha256": "a9dd75e8f4a12d07f408a46c9138a2186eabe271270ac83d15a4d433c61a45d0", "ja": "ねえねえ驚いた？　ジャストタイミングでの\nフレンズ登場に驚いちゃった！？", "zh": "欸欸，有没有吓到？\n被登场时机绝佳的好朋友们给吓到了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
